def save(batch,slug,variant,prompt,req,choices,reason=None):
 ids=list(dict.fromkeys(c for _,_,cs in req for c in cs));d={'depicted_variant':variant,'prompt':header+prompt+end,'basis_claim_ids':ids,'visual_requirements':[{'kind':k,'description':s,'claim_ids':cs} for k,s,cs in req],'aura':'No generic aura. Presence comes from documented anatomy and action: '+', '.join(ids)+'.','artistic_choices':choices}
 if reason:d['reason']=reason
 p=f'data/artwork-generated/batch-{batch}/drafts/resume_2000_a/{slug}-spec.json';os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p),exist_ok=True);json.dump(d,open(p,'w'),indent=2)
save(2079,'hairen','Untameable webbed sea humanoid with hanging hakama-like living skin', '''Hairen, the untameable sea humanoid. This is a COMPLETE REDRAW with new, clean, anatomically separated composition.
ANATOMY: ONE humanlike head, TWO eyes, TWO arms, TWO legs [hairen-c01]. BOTH hands clearly display FIVE WEBBED digits: one separate thumb and four fingers, thin living skin membrane BETWEEN all digits. BOTH feet clearly display FIVE webbed toes including large inner toe. Hands never touch or overlap feet. Broad loose living grey-olive SKIN folds hang like hakama trousers over hips/thighs [hairen-c02,c03]. Fully opaque plain charcoal undergarment covers torso and pelvis under skin flaps. Not woven trousers, no seams or hems on skin. Feral humanlike face with bared ordinary teeth, wet tangled hair, narrowed defiant eyes; no fins, gills, horns or pointed ears.
MOMENT: Surge upright out of the sea onto a broad flat rock toward viewer, back bent aggressively forward, shoulders hunched. Both arms held outward at SHOULDER HEIGHT, palms toward viewer, all five webbed digits spread widely and separated in silhouette. Both legs apart below hips. Both feet planted on two separated foreground rocks with toes facing viewer, visibly attached through ankles to separate legs. Hands in upper half, feet in lower corners: four extremities never overlap. Make every digit countable; leave uncluttered dark background behind each hand and foot.
POWER: No magic. Fierce untameable character [hairen-c05] expressed as defiant bodily confrontation. Ordinary surf splashes against rocks.
SCALE & CAMERA: Slight low angle, full tightly framed figure, face upper central, hands beside face, feet bottom, no giant scale.
LIGHT & WEATHER: one hard cold moon side-light against deep walnut black night, strong edge light on web membranes, ordinary sea spray.
SURFACE: Wet slick living skin, heavy glossy skin folds, coarse opaque charcoal undergarment, salt-wet rock.
SETTING: Sea coast rocks at night, dark sea behind [hairen-c01,c02].
MOOD: dangerous uncanny sea being confronting viewer, never ordinary relaxed man.''', [('anatomy','Sea humanoid, two five-digit webbed hands and two separate five-toed webbed feet',['hairen-c01','hairen-c02']),('anatomy','Loose living skin hanging like hakama over opaque undergarment',['hairen-c03']),('effect','Untameable defiant confrontation; no magic',['hairen-c05']),('setting','Sea and coastal rocks',['hairen-c01'])],['Upright separated limbs make webbed digits countable; five digits follow humanlike anatomy and Claude correction, without invented fins/gills.','Grey-olive skin, opaque modesty layer, moonlight and coastal rocks are editorial choices. No unsupported giant scale.'])
save(2079,'idlirvirissong','Uncanny female sky spirit baiting laughter through dancing grimaces', '''Idlirvirissong, hostile sky-house spirit who dances and makes grimaces to bait laughter.
ANATOMY: ONE female supernatural spirit, one head, two eyes, two arms, two legs, completely opaque Arctic hide garments [idlirvirissong-c02,c04,c09]. HER DEFINING FEATURE is a strongly UPTURNED NOSE WITH BOTH SIDES TURNED UP: a broad tip curls upwards and each side curls upwards, making an unmistakable three-lobed sculptural silhouette. It is her own supernatural facial trait, no costume nose. Strong theatrical painterly stylization, NOT a photographic portrait or ethnic caricature. Asymmetrical uncanny GRIMACE: one eye wide, one narrowed, lips pulled sideways into a tense baiting grimace with ordinary teeth, NO cheerful smile, no modern clown paint or costume.
MOMENT: Stomp one foot forward while lifting the other knee, both arms angled in jerky crooked dance, head thrust toward viewer, staring challengingly as if daring laughter [idlirvirissong-c05,c11]. Face and upturned nose large and clear at 200px.
POWER: No supernatural glow; dangerous test of laughter expressed by confrontational dance only. No victims, entrails or injury [idlirvirissong-c06].
SCALE & CAMERA: Tight full-figure low-angle painterly composition, looming through framing not invented giant size. Face unusually close to viewer due to forward lean, fills upper third.
LIGHT & WEATHER: A single low amber interior lamp illuminates face from below, deep walnut shadows, cold moon edge light at threshold.
SURFACE: weathered opaque hide clothing with rough seams, rough timber, cloud vapor.
SETTING: Her timber house FLOATS HIGH IN THE SKY; show exterior threshold and a broken-open side of the doorway with vast cloudbanks visibly BELOW THE FLOOR and around sill, no ground or trees [idlirvirissong-c05,c09]. Five lean hungry dogs with closed mouths, tucked bellies, angular shoulders, ears alert and eyes watchful crowd the lower side edges, focused on a large EMPTY PLATE beside her feet, qengmerping [idlirvirissong-c02,c05,c06]. No friendly smiling pets. Dogs and plate do not hide spirit legs.
MOOD: Disturbing dangerous clown-like supernatural performance, baiting and hostile, not cheerful. Respectfully original stylized spirit, no realistic ethnic portrait.''', [('anatomy','Female spirit, nose turned up on sides, clown-like grimaces',['idlirvirissong-c02','idlirvirissong-c04','idlirvirissong-c09','idlirvirissong-c11']),('effect','Dance baits laughter; lean watchful dogs and empty qengmerping plate, no gore',['idlirvirissong-c05','idlirvirissong-c06']),('setting','House plainly in sky above cloudbanks',['idlirvirissong-c05','idlirvirissong-c09'])],['Stylized painterly anatomy makes specific nose readable without photographic ethnic caricature; five dogs represents numerous dogs, not source count.','Opaque hide garment and single lamp are editorial. No supernatural physical effect, no gore.'])
